            </note>
            <note corresp="#d17-f2" n="2" xml:id="d17-f2-content">
                <p>Gen. Thomas T. Handy, Commander in Chief of U.S. Forces in Europe (CINCEUR) and U.S. Senior Military
                    Representative for MDAP in Europe.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
